name b1
repeat 2 times:
say hello
count from 1 to 3:
print the count
end
beep
end
say "done"
show
new
name b2
ask for a number and print its double
if it is bigger than 10: say big
else
say small
show
new
name b3
forever: wait for a key
if the key is q: stop
end
say again, new line
show
new
name b4
count from 1 to 3:
count down from 2:
print the count
end
say next, new line
top
clear the screen
go 4
del
show
mem
quit
